sequenceDiagram
  %% docs/reference/tools.md#remove-a-tool. R1: a record-only change starts no run.
  %% status: draft
  %% command: tool:remove
  %% kind: tool.remove
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Node 12<br/>reached over ssh
  CLI->>GW: tool:remove 31
  %%> Command:
  %%> - `orbit tool:remove 31 --yes`
  %%> - syntax: `<tool> [--yes] [--idempotency-key=KEY] [--json]`
  Note over GW: Validate, lock the Tool<br/>task #5135 · ripgrep on Node 12
  alt protected host software, a Tool Orbit does not own outside an apt repository, or host Conn membership
    Note over GW: Delete only the record<br/>no run, package stays
    %%> Why:
    %%> - the recipe owns the package; removing it would break the role
    %%> - a Tool owns its package only when Orbit recorded it: a successful install, an adoption or a convergence that installed it; no failure, retry, cleanup or sibling changes that
    %%> - withdrawing a host Conn membership leaves the service running and excludes it from future release rollouts
    GW-->>CLI: Tool removed<br/>package or service kept
  else Orbit owns the package, or the Tool's apt repository needs a repin
    GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-tool-write
    GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5135
    SW->>SW: Prepare native SSH<br/>admitted intent · pinned host key
    SW->>N: Remove the Tool<br/>native SSH
    %%> Scope:
    %%> - repin the owned remaining packages of the Tool's apt repository; the repository stays, even after its last Tool
    %%> - `package_owned: false` skips every package read and plan, keeps the package and only repins
    %%> - a removal that would also remove a held recipe package is refused
    SW->>N: Read resulting state<br/>native SSH
    alt check passes
      SW-->>GW: Run succeeded
      Note over GW: Delete the Tool record
    else the removal fails
      SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code
      Note over GW: Mark the Tool failed
      %%> Retry:
      %%> - a failed repin keeps the Tool failed with `tool.repository_failed`
      %%> - run the same command again after a fix
      %%> - a timed-out removal, its start reply lost included, keeps no uninstall authority until its receipt or Swamp shows the package was never reached
      %%> - until Swamp answers whether an unbound timed-out start became a run, the retry refuses with `tool.removal_unsettled`
      %%> - a package step that ran, a nonzero exit included, ends uninstall authority unless the check after it finds the package still present, whatever its version
    end
    loop every 2 s until terminal
      CLI->>GW: operation:show #5135
      GW-->>CLI: status + result
    end
  end
